<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#isRealizedBy> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:label "is realized by"@en ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:comment "Inverse of arto:realizes. Inferred by HermiT — not asserted in ETL."@en ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DesignArtefact> ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:range <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#ImplementationArtefact> ;
                                                
                                                owl:inverseOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#realizes> .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#isRefinedBy

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#isRefinedBy> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:label "is refined by"@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:comment "Inverse of arto:refines. Inferred by HermiT — not asserted in ETL."@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:range <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DesignArtefact> ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#RequirementsArtefact> ;
                                               
                                               owl:inverseOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#refines> .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#isRelatedTraceLink

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#isRelatedTraceLink> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                                      
                                                      rdfs:label "is related trace link"@en ;
                                                      
                                                      rdfs:comment "Links related TraceLink individuals e.g. an InferredLink to the AssertedLinks that triggered its inference. Supports CQ6 provenance queries."@en ;
                                                      
                                                      rdfs:range <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLink> ;
                                                      
                                                      rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLink> .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#isRepresentedAs

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#isRepresentedAs> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:label "is represented as"@en ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:comment "Inverse of arto:refersToArtefact. An AgileArtefact can be represented as a BacklogItem in multiple sprints (if carried over)."@en ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:range <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#BacklogItem> ;
                                                   
                                                   owl:inverseOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#refersToArtefact> .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#isStoryOf

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#isStoryOf> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:label "is story of"@en ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:comment "Inverse of arto:hasStory. Inferred by HermiT — not asserted in ETL."@en ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:range <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Epic> ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#UserStory> ;
                                             
                                             owl:inverseOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#hasStory> .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#isSupersededBy

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#isSupersededBy> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:label "is superseded by"@en ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:comment "Inverse of arto:supersedes. Inferred by HermiT — not asserted in ETL."@en ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:range <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                                  
                                                  owl:inverseOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#supersedes> .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#isTracedFrom

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#isTracedFrom> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:label "is traced from"@en ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:comment "Inverse of arto:tracesTo. Inferred by HermiT — not asserted in ETL."@en ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:range <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#CodeCommit> ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SprintTask> ;
                                                
                                                owl:inverseOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#tracesTo> .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#isVerifiedBy

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#isVerifiedBy> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:label "is verified by"@en ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:comment "Inverse of arto:verifies. Inferred by HermiT — not asserted in ETL."@en ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:range <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TestCase> ;
                                                
                                                owl:inverseOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#verifies> .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#realizes

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#realizes> rdf:type owl:AsymmetricProperty ,
                                                     owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:label "realizes"@en ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:comment "An ImplementationArtefact realizes a DesignArtefact by providing a concrete implementation. Literature-grounded: Ramesh & Jarke (2001) Realises link type. TAWOS: Implements/Completes (30 links — Query 4). Asymmetric. Distinct from tracesTo (CodeCommit→SprintTask) — realizes captures the higher-level design-to-implementation RT link."@en ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:range <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DesignArtefact> ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#ImplementationArtefact> ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#hasTraceLink> .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#references

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#references> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ,
                                                       owl:SymmetricProperty ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:label "references"@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:comment "Explicit citation or pointer between artefacts. TAWOS: Reference (39,826 links). Symmetric. Dominant in Suggestion↔Suggestion (17,147) and Bug↔Bug (13,027)."@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:range <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#hasTraceLink> .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#refersToArtefact

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#refersToArtefact> rdf:type owl:FunctionalProperty ,
                                                             owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                                    
                                                    rdfs:label "refers to artefact"@en ;
                                                    
                                                    rdfs:comment "Links a BacklogItem to the AgileArtefact it represents in the sprint context. Functional — each BacklogItem refers to exactly one AgileArtefact. Core M1-M3 bridge: BacklogItem(M3) → AgileArtefact(M1). Enables CQ1 sprint decomposition queries: which UserStories are in sprint X?"@en ;
                                                    
                                                    rdfs:range <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                                    
                                                    rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#BacklogItem> .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#refersToIssue

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#refersToIssue> rdf:type owl:FunctionalProperty ,
                                                          owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:label "refers to issue"@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:comment "Links a TermVariant to the AgileArtefact individual it labels. Functional — each TermVariant labels exactly one AgileArtefact. Core M4-M1 bridge: TermVariant(M4) → AgileArtefact(M1)."@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:range <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TermVariant> .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#refines

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#refines> rdf:type owl:AsymmetricProperty ,
                                                    owl:IrreflexiveProperty ,
                                                    owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                           
                                           rdfs:label "refines"@en ;
                                           
                                           rdfs:comment "A DesignArtefact refines a RequirementsArtefact by adding implementation detail. Literature-grounded: Ramesh & Jarke (2001) Refines link type. Zero TAWOS occurrences — waterfall-era link type absent from Jira-based Agile projects. Excluded from TAWOS Part 9 evaluation. Included for Ramesh & Jarke coverage completeness and multi-dataset comparability."@en ;
                                           
                                           rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DesignArtefact> ;
                                           
                                           rdfs:range <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#RequirementsArtefact> ;
                                           
                                           rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#hasTraceLink> .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#relatesTo

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#relatesTo> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ,
                                                      owl:SymmetricProperty ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:label "relates to"@en ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:comment "General associative RT link between any two artefacts. TAWOS: Relates/Related/Relate (71,674 links). Symmetric. Backbone of the TAWOS RT chain — present across all artefact type pairs."@en ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:range <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#hasTraceLink> .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#reportedIn

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#reportedIn> rdf:type owl:AsymmetricProperty ,
                                                       owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:label "reported in"@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:comment "Links a Bug to the UserStory in which it was discovered. TAWOS: Bug→Story (2,425 links). Asymmetric. Critical for CQ4 impact propagation — a bug reported in a story propagates change impact upstream."@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Bug> ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:range <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#UserStory> ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#hasTraceLink> .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#supersedes

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#supersedes> rdf:type owl:AsymmetricProperty ,
                                                       owl:IrreflexiveProperty ,
                                                       owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:label "supersedes"@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:comment "One artefact replaces or obsoletes another. TAWOS: Supersession/Supercedes/Supersede (1,200 links). Asymmetric and Irreflexive. Important for RequirementCandidate evolution — a Suggestion superseded by a UserStory documents the acceptance decision trail."@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:range <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#hasTraceLink> .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#tracesTo

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#tracesTo> rdf:type owl:AsymmetricProperty ,
                                                     owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:label "traces to"@en ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:comment "A CodeCommit traces to the SprintTask it implements. Literature-grounded: Ramesh & Jarke Realises link type. TAWOS bridge: Pull_Request_URL on 646 issues connects to code level. Asymmetric. Completes the RT chain: Epic → UserStory → SprintTask ← CodeCommit."@en ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#CodeCommit> ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:range <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SprintTask> ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#hasTraceLink> .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#triggeredDrift

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#triggeredDrift> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:label "triggered drift"@en ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:comment "Links a TermVariant to DriftEvent individuals it participated in. A TermVariant triggers a drift when its rawLabel changes (from=old variant, to=new variant)."@en ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:range <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DriftEvent> ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TermVariant> .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#verifies

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#verifies> rdf:type owl:AsymmetricProperty ,
                                                     owl:IrreflexiveProperty ,
                                                     owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:label "verifies"@en ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:comment "A TestCase verifies a UserStory, SprintTask or Bug. TAWOS: Tested/QA Test/Bonfire Testing (6,016 links). Asymmetric and Irreflexive. Core CQ3 property — stories with no incoming verifies link are test coverage gaps. Domain restricted to TestCase."@en ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:range <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TestCase> ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#hasTraceLink> .





#################################################################
#
#    Data properties
#
#################################################################


###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType_label

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType_label> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                                owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                                       
                                                       rdfs:label "type label"@en ;
                                                       
                                                       rdfs:comment "Human-readable label for this TraceLinkType cluster."@en ;
                                                       
                                                       rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType> ;
                                                       
                                                       rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType_properties

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType_properties> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                            
                                                            rdfs:label "covered properties"@en ;
                                                            
                                                            rdfs:comment "Comma-separated list of arto: RT properties covered by this TraceLinkType cluster."@en ;
                                                            
                                                            rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType> ;
                                                            
                                                            rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType_tawosVolume

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType_tawosVolume> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                             
                                                             rdfs:label "TAWOS volume"@en ;
                                                             
                                                             rdfs:comment "Total number of TAWOS Issue_Links rows mapped to this TraceLinkType cluster. Grounded in Query 4 results."@en ;
                                                             
                                                             rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType> ;
                                                             
                                                             rdfs:range xsd:integer .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#acceptanceCriteria

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#acceptanceCriteria> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                      
                                                      rdfs:label "acceptance criteria"@en ;
                                                      
                                                      rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue.Description_Code (Text). Conditions for story acceptance."@en ;
                                                      
                                                      rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#UserStory> ;
                                                      
                                                      rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#activatedDate

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#activatedDate> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:label "activated date"@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Sprint.Activated_Date (DateTime). When the sprint was formally started. NULL for some sprints — optional property."@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Sprint> ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:range xsd:dateTime .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#affectedUsers

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#affectedUsers> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:label "affected users"@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:comment "Number of users affected by this support issue. Literature-grounded. Higher values signal higher priority for bug traceability."@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SupportRequest> ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:range xsd:integer .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#approvalDate

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#approvalDate> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:label "approval date"@en ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:comment "Date when this design artefact was formally approved. Literature-grounded."@en ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DesignArtefact> ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:range xsd:dateTime .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#approvedBy

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#approvedBy> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:label "approved by"@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:comment "ID of the reviewer or architect who approved this design artefact. Literature-grounded. Connects to Developer/Agent when M3 is built."@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DesignArtefact> ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:range xsd:integer .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#assertionMethod

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#assertionMethod> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                            owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:label "assertion method"@en ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:comment "How this TraceLink was created. Values: ETL (from TAWOS Issue_Links), SWRL (HermiT inferred), Manual (human-asserted). Core CQ6 property."@en ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLink> ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#assigneeId

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#assigneeId> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:label "assignee ID"@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue.Assignee_ID (Int). Foreign key to User table. Preserves agent assignment information without requiring Agent class individuals — User table has only ID and Project_ID, no name or role data. AgentRole ODP dropped: role cannot be determined from TAWOS data."@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:range xsd:integer .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#authorId

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#authorId> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:label "author ID"@en ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:comment "The developer who authored this commit. Literature-grounded. Connects to Developer/Agent individuals in M3 via AgentRole ODP. Forward-compatible: pending Git integration."@en ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#CodeCommit> ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#backlogId

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#backlogId> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                      owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:label "backlog ID"@en ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:comment "Unique identifier for this SprintBacklog. Derived by ETL: Sprint.ID used as backlog ID since each sprint has exactly one backlog. One-to-one relationship with Sprint."@en ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SprintBacklog> ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:range xsd:integer .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#backlogItemOrder

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#backlogItemOrder> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                    
                                                    rdfs:label "backlog item order"@en ;
                                                    
                                                    rdfs:comment "The priority ordering of this BacklogItem within its SprintBacklog. TAWOS: derived from Issue.Priority field (Highest=1, High=2, Medium=3, Low=4, Lowest=5). Supports sprint planning analysis."@en ;
                                                    
                                                    rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#BacklogItem> ;
                                                    
                                                    rdfs:range xsd:integer .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#backlogSize

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#backlogSize> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                        owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:label "backlog size"@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:comment "Total number of BacklogItems in this SprintBacklog at sprint start. TAWOS: COUNT(Issue WHERE Sprint_ID = s.ID). Populated by ETL from Sprint + Issue join."@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SprintBacklog> ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:range xsd:integer .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#branchName

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#branchName> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:label "branch name"@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:comment "The Git branch on which this commit was made. Literature-grounded: Git SCM branching model. Forward-compatible: pending Git integration."@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#CodeCommit> ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#buildSystem

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#buildSystem> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:label "build system"@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:comment "The CI/CD system that generated this build failure e.g. Jenkins, Travis CI, GitHub Actions. Literature-grounded."@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#BuildFailure> ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#canonicalLabel

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#canonicalLabel> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                           owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:label "canonical label"@en ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:comment "The normalised, canonical form of this term variant. ETL: derived from Issue.Title by lowercasing, removing punctuation, and stemming. Used as the primary matching key for synonym detection across projects."@en ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TermVariant> ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#carriedOver

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#carriedOver> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                        owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:label "carried over"@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:comment "Whether this BacklogItem was not completed and carried to the next sprint. TAWOS: derived — Issue.Sprint_ID changes between sprints for the same issue. True = issue appears in multiple sprint assignments."@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#BacklogItem> ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:range xsd:boolean .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#changedFiles

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#changedFiles> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:label "changed files"@en ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:comment "Number of files modified in this commit. Literature-grounded: Git commit metadata. Forward-compatible property — large values signal high-risk commits for defect traceability. Pending Git integration."@en ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#CodeCommit> ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:range xsd:integer .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#clusterConfidence

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#clusterConfidence> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                              owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                                     
                                                     rdfs:label "cluster confidence"@en ;
                                                     
                                                     rdfs:comment "Confidence score for this synonym cluster. Range 0.0–1.0. Computed by ETL from term co-occurrence frequency across projects. Higher values indicate more reliable synonymy."@en ;
                                                     
                                                     rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SynonymCluster> ;
                                                     
                                                     rdfs:range xsd:decimal .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#clusterLabel

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#clusterLabel> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                         owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:label "cluster label"@en ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:comment "The canonical concept label this SynonymCluster represents e.g. 'authentication', 'login', 'user-story'. Used as the cluster's identifier for CQ8 resolution queries."@en ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SynonymCluster> ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#clusterSize

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#clusterSize> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                        owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:label "cluster size"@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:comment "Number of TermVariant individuals in this SynonymCluster. Minimum 2 — a cluster with one term is not a synonym cluster. Larger clusters indicate higher terminological diversity across TAWOS projects."@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SynonymCluster> ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:range xsd:integer .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#commitDate

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#commitDate> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                       owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:label "commit date"@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:comment "Timestamp of when this commit was pushed to the repository. Literature-grounded. Enables temporal RT chain analysis — commits after story closure indicate scope creep."@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#CodeCommit> ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:range xsd:dateTime .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#commitHash

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#commitHash> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                       owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:label "commit hash"@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:comment "The unique SHA hash identifying this commit in the Git repository. Literature-grounded: Git SCM. Primary key for CodeCommit individuals in future Git-integrated datasets."@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#CodeCommit> ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#commitMessage

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#commitMessage> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:label "commit message"@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:comment "The developer-authored message describing changes in this commit. Literature-grounded. Key field for NLP-based traceability recovery in planned BERT hybrid extension."@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#CodeCommit> ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#completeDate

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#completeDate> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:label "complete date"@en ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Sprint.Complete_Date (DateTime). When the sprint was formally closed. Only populated for CLOSED sprints. Key property for velocity and throughput analysis."@en ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Sprint> ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:range xsd:dateTime .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#completionRate

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#completionRate> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                           owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:label "completion rate"@en ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:comment "Percentage of sprint issues reaching Done/Closed status. Computed by ETL: throughput / totalIssues * 100. Query 17 confirms near-100% completion rate for most CLOSED TAWOS sprints. Key sprint health indicator."@en ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Sprint> ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:range xsd:decimal .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#componentId

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#componentId> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:label "component ID"@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Component.ID (Int). Foreign key from issue_component table. Preserved for provenance and cross-project component matching in M4."@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:range xsd:integer .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#componentName

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#componentName> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:label "component name"@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Component.Name via issue_component junction table. The project component this artefact belongs to e.g. iOS, Android, Sharding, Administration. Represents project architecture decomposition — modelled as data property not class since components have no RT link participation in TAWOS Issue_Links. Top components: iOS (7,815) · Android (7,145) · Sharding (7,135) · Replication (6,712)."@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#confidenceScore

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#confidenceScore> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                            owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:label "confidence score"@en ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:comment "Confidence of this TraceLink. Range: 0.0–1.0. AssertedLinks: 1.0 (ground truth). InferredLinks: set by SWRL rule confidence. Literature-grounded: supports future probabilistic RT extensions."@en ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLink> ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:range xsd:decimal .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#createdAt

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#createdAt> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:label "created at"@en ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue.Creation_Date (DateTime). When this artefact was created."@en ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:range xsd:dateTime .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#creatorId

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#creatorId> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:label "creator ID"@en ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue.Creator_ID (Int). Foreign key to User table. Who created this artefact in Jira."@en ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:range xsd:integer .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#defectsFound

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#defectsFound> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:label "defects found"@en ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:comment "Number of defects discovered during this test execution. Literature-grounded. When > 0, connects TestResult to Bug individuals via isCausedBy property chain."@en ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TestResult> ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:range xsd:integer .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#description

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#description> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:label "description"@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue.Description_Text (Text). Free-text description."@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#designLevel

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#designLevel> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                        owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:label "design level"@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:comment "The abstraction level of this design artefact. Values: System, Subsystem, Component, Module. Literature-grounded: IEEE 42010 Architecture Description standard."@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DesignArtefact> ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#designVersion

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#designVersion> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:label "design version"@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:comment "Version number of this design document e.g. v1.0, v2.3. Literature-grounded. Supports design evolution traceability."@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DesignArtefact> ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#documentType

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#documentType> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:label "document type"@en ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:comment "The type of documentation artefact e.g. API documentation, user guide, release notes, inline comment. Literature-grounded."@en ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Documentation> ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#documentUrl

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#documentUrl> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:label "document URL"@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue.URL (String). Link to the documentation resource. Optional — not all documentation issues have an external URL."@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Documentation> ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:range xsd:anyURI .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#driftAuthorId

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#driftAuthorId> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:label "drift author ID"@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Change_Log.Author_ID (Int). Who made the terminological change. Foreign key to User table."@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DriftEvent> ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:range xsd:integer .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#driftDate

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#driftDate> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                      owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:label "drift date"@en ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Change_Log.Creation_Date (DateTime). When this terminological change occurred. Enables temporal drift analysis — which sprint did the terminology change in?"@en ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DriftEvent> ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:range xsd:dateTime .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#driftEventId

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#driftEventId> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                         owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:label "drift event ID"@en ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Change_Log.ID (Int). Primary key of the Change_Log row that triggered this DriftEvent."@en ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DriftEvent> ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:range xsd:integer .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#driftIssueId

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#driftIssueId> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                         owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:label "drift issue ID"@en ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Change_Log.Issue_ID (Int). The Issue whose title changed. Foreign key to Issue table — links DriftEvent back to the affected AgileArtefact."@en ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DriftEvent> ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:range xsd:integer .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#driftType

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#driftType> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                      owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:label "drift type"@en ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:comment "Classification of this drift event. Values: TitleDrift (Field=summary change) · LinkNameDrift (Issue_Links.Name does not map to TraceLinkType cluster) · StatusDrift (Field=status change affecting traceability). Primary source: TitleDrift from Change_Log. Secondary: LinkNameDrift from ETL mismatch detection."@en ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DriftEvent> ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#endDate

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#endDate> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                    owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                           
                                           rdfs:label "end date"@en ;
                                           
                                           rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Sprint.End_Date (DateTime). Planned sprint end date. May differ from Complete_Date for overrun sprints."@en ;
                                           
                                           rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Sprint> ;
                                           
                                           rdfs:range xsd:dateTime .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#estimationDate

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#estimationDate> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:label "estimation date"@en ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue.Estimation_Date (DateTime). When story points were estimated for this task."@en ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SprintTask> ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:range xsd:dateTime .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#executionDate

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#executionDate> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                          owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:label "execution date"@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:comment "When this test was executed. Literature-grounded: IEEE 829. Supports temporal traceability analysis across sprints."@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TestResult> ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:range xsd:dateTime .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#failedStage

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#failedStage> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:label "failed stage"@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:comment "The pipeline stage at which the build failed e.g. compile, test, package, deploy. Literature-grounded. Connects to TestCase via verifies property when failure is test-related."@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#BuildFailure> ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#fromLabel

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#fromLabel> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                      owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:label "from label"@en ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Change_Log.From_String (Text). The original title before the drift occurred. Preserved as the pre-drift term variant."@en ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DriftEvent> ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#hasEventStatus

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#hasEventStatus> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                           owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:label "has event status"@en ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:comment "Event ODP property. The current state of this Event e.g. Planned, Active, Completed. Mapped to Sprint.State in TAWOS in Step 5."@en ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Event> ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#inProgressMinutes

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#inProgressMinutes> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                     
                                                     rdfs:label "in progress (minutes)"@en ;
                                                     
                                                     rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue.In_Progress_Minutes (Double). Total time the bug spent In Progress."@en ;
                                                     
                                                     rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Bug> ;
                                                     
                                                     rdfs:range xsd:decimal .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#isAccepted

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#isAccepted> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                       owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:label "is accepted"@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:comment "Tracks whether this RequirementCandidate has been accepted into a sprint. Set to true by ETL when Issue.Sprint_ID IS NOT NULL AND Issue.Status = Done. Triggers SWRL re-classification to UserStory in Step 6."@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#RequirementCandidate> ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:range xsd:boolean .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#isArchived

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#isArchived> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                       owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:label "is archived"@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Version.Archived (Boolean). True = this version is no longer actively maintained. Directly maps from TAWOS Version table boolean field."@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Version> ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:range xsd:boolean .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#isCompleted

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#isCompleted> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                        owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:label "is completed"@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:comment "Whether this BacklogItem was completed within its sprint. TAWOS: Issue.Status IN ('Done','Closed'). True = completed · False = carried over or incomplete. Core metric for sprint completion rate and velocity calculation."@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#BacklogItem> ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:range xsd:boolean .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#isInferred

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#isInferred> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                       owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:label "is inferred"@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:comment "Whether this TraceLink was inferred by HermiT SWRL rules (true) or asserted directly from TAWOS Issue_Links (false). Core CQ6 property — enables inferred vs asserted link ratio calculation."@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLink> ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:range xsd:boolean .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#isReleased

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#isReleased> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                       owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:label "is released"@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Version.Released (Boolean). True = this version has been shipped to users. Directly maps from TAWOS Version table boolean field."@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Version> ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:range xsd:boolean .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#issueId

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#issueId> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                    owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                           
                                           rdfs:label "issue ID"@en ;
                                           
                                           rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue.ID (Int). Primary key. Uniquely identifies any AgileArtefact individual."@en ;
                                           
                                           rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                           
                                           rdfs:range xsd:integer .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#issueKey

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#issueKey> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                     owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:label "issue key"@en ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue.Issue_Key (String). Human-readable Jira key e.g. PROJ-42."@en ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#issueType

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#issueType> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                      owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:label "issue type"@en ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue.Type (String). Raw TAWOS type string preserved for provenance and M4 drift analysis. ETL routing uses this value to classify individuals into leaf classes."@en ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#jiraSprintId

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#jiraSprintId> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                         owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:label "Jira sprint ID"@en ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Sprint.Jira_ID (Int). The Jira-internal sprint identifier. Preserved for cross-project sprint matching in M4."@en ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Sprint> ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:range xsd:integer .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#jiraVersionId

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#jiraVersionId> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                          owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:label "Jira version ID"@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Version.Jira_ID (Int). The Jira-internal version identifier. Preserved for provenance and cross-project version matching in M4."@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Version> ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:range xsd:integer .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#lastUpdated

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#lastUpdated> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:label "last updated"@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue.Last_Updated (DateTime). Most recent modification timestamp."@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:range xsd:dateTime .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#linkCreatedAt

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#linkCreatedAt> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:label "link created at"@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:comment "TAWOS: derived from Issue_Links creation context. When this trace link was established. Supports temporal RT chain analysis."@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLink> ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:range xsd:dateTime .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#linkDirection

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#linkDirection> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                          owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:label "link direction"@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue_Links.Direction (String). The Jira-level direction of this link e.g. inward, outward. Distinct from sdlcLinkDirection which captures SDLC phase direction."@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLink> ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#linkId

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#linkId> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                   owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                          
                                          rdfs:label "link ID"@en ;
                                          
                                          rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue_Links.ID (Int). Primary key of the Issue_Links table. Uniquely identifies an AssertedLink individual."@en ;
                                          
                                          rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLink> ;
                                          
                                          rdfs:range xsd:integer .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#linkName

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#linkName> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                     owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:label "link name"@en ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue_Links.Name (String). The raw TAWOS link type name e.g. Relates, Blocks, Duplicate. Preserved for M4 drift analysis and CQ7 distribution queries."@en ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLink> ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#maintenanceType

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#maintenanceType> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                            owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:label "maintenance type"@en ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue.Type (String). The raw TAWOS maintenance type — Documentation · Support Request · Build Failure · Problem Ticket. Preserved via arto:issueType but typed here for MaintenanceArtefact-specific querying."@en ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#MaintenanceArtefact> ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#modellingTool

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#modellingTool> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:label "modelling tool"@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:comment "The tool or notation used to produce this design artefact e.g. UML, ArchiMate, C4, ERD. Literature-grounded."@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DesignArtefact> ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#passed

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#passed> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                   owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                          
                                          rdfs:label "passed"@en ;
                                          
                                          rdfs:comment "Whether this test result passed or failed. Literature-grounded: IEEE 829. True = passed, False = failed. Key property for CQ3 test coverage analysis — failed TestResult individuals trigger defect traceability chain."@en ;
                                          
                                          rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TestResult> ;
                                          
                                          rdfs:range xsd:boolean .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#plannedVelocity

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#plannedVelocity> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:label "planned velocity"@en ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:comment "Total story points committed at sprint planning. TAWOS: SUM(Issue.Story_Point WHERE Sprint_ID = s.ID AND Story_Point IS NOT NULL). Distinct from arto:velocity which counts only completed items."@en ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SprintBacklog> ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:range xsd:decimal .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#priority

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#priority> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:label "priority"@en ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue.Priority (String). Values: Highest, High, Medium, Low, Lowest."@en ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#projectId

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#projectId> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                      owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:label "project ID"@en ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue.Project_ID (Int). Foreign key to Project table. Identifies which of the 11 TAWOS projects this artefact belongs to."@en ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:range xsd:integer .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#projectSource

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#projectSource> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                          owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:label "project source"@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue.Project_ID (Int). Which of the 11 TAWOS projects this TermVariant originates from. Enables cross-project synonym detection — same canonical label appearing in multiple projects signals a synonym cluster."@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TermVariant> ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:range xsd:integer .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#pullRequestUrl

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#pullRequestUrl> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:label "pull request URL"@en ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:comment "TAWOS bridge property: Issue.Pull_Request_URL (String). The one TAWOS field connecting issues to code-level artefacts. Present on 646 TAWOS issues (Story:347, Bug:154, Improvement:76, Technical task:27, New Feature:24, Task:18). Declared on ImplementationArtefact so all sprint-assigned artefacts can carry it."@en ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#ImplementationArtefact> ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:range xsd:anyURI .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#rawLabel

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#rawLabel> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:label "raw label"@en ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue.Title (String). The original, unmodified title string as it appears in TAWOS. Preserved for provenance and M4 drift analysis. Multiple raw labels may share the same canonical label."@en ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TermVariant> ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#releaseDate

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#releaseDate> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:label "release date"@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Version.Release_Date (DateTime). When this version was released. NULL for unshipped versions. Key property for temporal RT chain analysis — commits after releaseDate indicate post-release defects."@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Version> ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:range xsd:dateTime .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#reporterId

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#reporterId> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:label "reporter ID"@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue.Reporter_ID (Int). Foreign key to User table. Who reported this artefact — relevant for Bug and SupportRequest traceability."@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:range xsd:integer .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#repositoryUrl

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#repositoryUrl> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:label "repository URL"@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:comment "URL of the Git repository containing this commit. Partially grounded: TAWOS Repository table contains 12 project repository URLs (Query 7). Full population pending Git API integration."@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#CodeCommit> ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:range xsd:anyURI .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#requirementSource

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#requirementSource> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                     
                                                     rdfs:label "requirement source"@en ;
                                                     
                                                     rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue.Reporter_ID (Int). Who raised this requirement — user, product owner, or stakeholder."@en ;
                                                     
                                                     rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#RequirementsArtefact> ;
                                                     
                                                     rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#resolution

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#resolution> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:label "resolution"@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue.Resolution (String). How the bug was resolved e.g. Fixed, Won't Fix, Duplicate."@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Bug> ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#resolutionDate

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#resolutionDate> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:label "resolution date"@en ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue.Resolution_Date (DateTime). When this story was completed."@en ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#UserStory> ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:range xsd:dateTime .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#resolutionStatus

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#resolutionStatus> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                    
                                                    rdfs:label "resolution status"@en ;
                                                    
                                                    rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue.Resolution (String). How this maintenance artefact was resolved. Values vary by type: Documentation → Published/Outdated; SupportRequest → Resolved/Won't Fix; BuildFailure → Fixed/Known Issue."@en ;
                                                    
                                                    rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#MaintenanceArtefact> ;
                                                    
                                                    rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#resolutionTimeMinutes

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#resolutionTimeMinutes> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                         
                                                         rdfs:label "resolution time (minutes)"@en ;
                                                         
                                                         rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue.Resolution_Time_Minute (Double). Time taken to resolve the bug."@en ;
                                                         
                                                         rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Bug> ;
                                                         
                                                         rdfs:range xsd:decimal .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#resolvedByWordNet

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#resolvedByWordNet> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                              owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                                     
                                                     rdfs:label "resolved by WordNet"@en ;
                                                     
                                                     rdfs:comment "Whether this synonym cluster was validated against WordNet synonym sets. True = WordNet confirms synonymy · False = TAWOS co-occurrence only. WordNet + Agile glossaries were planned as S4 conversion sources in Parts 3–4."@en ;
                                                     
                                                     rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SynonymCluster> ;
                                                     
                                                     rdfs:range xsd:boolean .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#sdlcLinkDirection

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#sdlcLinkDirection> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                              owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                                     
                                                     rdfs:label "SDLC link direction"@en ;
                                                     
                                                     rdfs:comment "Direction of this TraceLink relative to the SDLC lifecycle. Set by ETL using source/target artefact class membership lookup. Values: Forward (Requirements→Implementation), Backward (Maintenance→Requirements), CrossCutting (Testing→Requirements), Horizontal (same SDLC phase). Enables CQ-SDLC1 full lifecycle chain queries."@en ;
                                                     
                                                     rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLink> ;
                                                     
                                                     rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#sourcePhase

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#sourcePhase> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                        owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:label "source phase"@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:comment "SDLC phase of the source artefact. Set by ETL. Values: Requirements · Design · Implementation · Testing · Deployment · Maintenance. Used with targetPhase to determine sdlcLinkDirection."@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLink> ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#sprintGoal

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#sprintGoal> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:label "sprint goal"@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:comment "The stated objective of this sprint. TAWOS: partially available from Sprint.Name field — sprint names like 'BACKEND Sprint 17' or 'Ingalls GA' encode implicit goals. Full sprint goal text not stored in TAWOS — populated from Sprint.Name ETL parsing or left NULL for unnamed sprints. Literature-grounded: Scrum Guide sprint goal concept."@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Sprint> ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#sprintId

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#sprintId> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                     owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:label "sprint ID"@en ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Sprint.ID (Int). Primary key. Uniquely identifies a Sprint individual."@en ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Sprint> ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:range xsd:integer .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#sprintName

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#sprintName> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                       owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:label "sprint name"@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Sprint.Name (String). Human-readable sprint name e.g. 'Sprint 12', 'GDPR Followup Sprint 1'. Names vary widely across projects — ETL preserves raw value for M4 drift analysis."@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Sprint> ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#sprintProjectId

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#sprintProjectId> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                            owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:label "sprint project ID"@en ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Sprint.Project_ID (Int). Foreign key to Project table. Links sprint to one of the 11 TAWOS projects."@en ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Sprint> ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:range xsd:integer .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#sprintState

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#sprintState> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                        owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:label "sprint state"@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Sprint.State (String). Confirmed values from Query 14: CLOSED · ACTIVE · FUTURE. ETL filter: WHERE Start_Date IS NOT NULL excludes virtual sprints (Kanban boards, version-named backlogs)."@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Sprint> ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#startDate

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#startDate> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                      owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:label "start date"@en ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Sprint.Start_Date (DateTime). Sprint start. Event ODP hasTimeInterval start anchor. ETL filter: WHERE Start_Date IS NOT NULL."@en ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Sprint> ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:range xsd:dateTime .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#status

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#status> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                   owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                          
                                          rdfs:label "status"@en ;
                                          
                                          rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue.Status (String). Workflow state e.g. To Do, In Progress, Done, Closed."@en ;
                                          
                                          rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                          
                                          rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#storyPointChangedAfterEstimation

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#storyPointChangedAfterEstimation> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                                    
                                                                    rdfs:label "story point changed after estimation"@en ;
                                                                    
                                                                    rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue.Story_Point_Changed_After_Estimation (Boolean). Flags scope creep on this task."@en ;
                                                                    
                                                                    rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SprintTask> ;
                                                                    
                                                                    rdfs:range xsd:boolean .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#storyPoints

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#storyPoints> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:label "story points"@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue.Story_Point (Double). Effort estimate. Only populated once a story is sprint-assigned."@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#UserStory> ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:range xsd:decimal .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#supportChannel

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#supportChannel> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:label "support channel"@en ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:comment "The channel through which this support request was received e.g. email, forum, helpdesk, community. Literature-grounded."@en ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SupportRequest> ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#targetPhase

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#targetPhase> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                        owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:label "target phase"@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:comment "SDLC phase of the target artefact. Set by ETL. Values: Requirements · Design · Implementation · Testing · Deployment · Maintenance."@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLink> ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#termFrequency

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#termFrequency> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                          owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:label "term frequency"@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:comment "How many times this term label appears in TAWOS across all issues. ETL: COUNT(Issue WHERE Title LIKE canonicalLabel). Higher frequency terms are more reliable synonym anchors."@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TermVariant> ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:range xsd:integer .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#termType

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#termType> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                     owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:label "term type"@en ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:comment "The ARTO class this TermVariant is associated with. Values: UserStory · Bug · Improvement · Suggestion · SprintTask · Documentation. Scopes synonym resolution to artefacts of the same type."@en ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TermVariant> ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#testEnvironment

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#testEnvironment> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:label "test environment"@en ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:comment "The environment in which this test case is executed e.g. staging, production, CI. Literature-grounded."@en ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TestCase> ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#testScript

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#testScript> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:label "test script"@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:comment "The test script or procedure associated with this TestCase. Literature-grounded: IEEE 829 standard for software test documentation."@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TestCase> ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#testType

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#testType> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                     owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:label "test type"@en ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue.Type (String). Values: Test · Test Task. Preserved via arto:issueType but typed here for TestCase-specific querying."@en ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TestCase> ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#testedBy

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#testedBy> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:label "tested by"@en ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:comment "The tester or automated system that executed this test. Literature-grounded: Maro et al. (2022) TracIMo. Connects to Developer/Agent in M3."@en ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TestResult> ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#throughput

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#throughput> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                       owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:label "throughput"@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:comment "Count of issues reaching Done or Closed status in this sprint. TAWOS: COUNT(Issue WHERE Sprint_ID = s.ID AND Status IN ('Done','Closed')). Query 17 confirmed throughput ≈ total_issues for most CLOSED sprints — high completion rate across TAWOS projects. Complements velocity for teams not using story points."@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Sprint> ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:range xsd:integer .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#timeSpent

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#timeSpent> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:label "time spent"@en ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue.Timespent (Double). Actual effort logged."@en ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#UserStory> ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:range xsd:decimal .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#title

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#title> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                         
                                         rdfs:label "title"@en ;
                                         
                                         rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue.Title (String). Display name of the artefact."@en ;
                                         
                                         rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                         
                                         rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#toLabel

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#toLabel> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                    owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                           
                                           rdfs:label "to label"@en ;
                                           
                                           rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Change_Log.To_String (Text). The new title after the drift occurred. The post-drift term variant."@en ;
                                           
                                           rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DriftEvent> ;
                                           
                                           rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#totalEffortMinutes

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#totalEffortMinutes> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                      
                                                      rdfs:label "total effort (minutes)"@en ;
                                                      
                                                      rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Issue.Total_Effort_Minutes (Double). Total effort logged against this task."@en ;
                                                      
                                                      rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SprintTask> ;
                                                      
                                                      rdfs:range xsd:decimal .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#totalIssues

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#totalIssues> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                        owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:label "total issues"@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:comment "Total number of issues assigned to this sprint. TAWOS: COUNT(Issue WHERE Sprint_ID = s.ID). Query 17: range 5–87 issues per sprint across top 15 closed sprints. Denominator for sprint completion rate calculation."@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Sprint> ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:range xsd:integer .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#velocity

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#velocity> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                     owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:label "velocity"@en ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:comment "Sum of Story_Point values for all CLOSED/Done issues in this sprint. TAWOS: SUM(Issue.Story_Point WHERE Sprint_ID = s.ID AND Status IN ('Done','Closed')). ETL outlier filter: WHERE Story_Point < 1000 (Query 17 confirmed data quality issue: Ingalls GA = 26,710,115 story points). Standard Scrum velocity metric. Enables sprint-over-sprint velocity trend analysis for CQ7."@en ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Sprint> ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:range xsd:decimal .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#versionId

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#versionId> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                      owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:label "version ID"@en ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Version.ID (Int). Primary key of the Version table. Used as owl:hasKey for Version individuals."@en ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Version> ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:range xsd:integer .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#versionName

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#versionName> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                        owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:label "version name"@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:comment "TAWOS: Version.Name (String). Human-readable version identifier e.g. '1.3 GA', '2.0 M1', '1.3 RC1'. Raw string preserved — ETL parses this to set versionType."@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Version> ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:range xsd:string .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#versionType

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#versionType> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ,
                                                        owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:label "version type"@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:comment "Classification of this version derived from Version.Name by ETL. Values: Milestone (Name contains M1/M2/M3) · ReleaseCandidate (Name contains RC) · GeneralAvailability (Name contains GA or Released=1) · Planned (Release_Date IS NULL) · Other. Single flat class design — lifecycle distinction handled here rather than via subclasses due to inconsistent naming across 37 TAWOS projects."@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:domain <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Version> ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:range xsd:string .





#################################################################
#
#    Classes
#
#################################################################


###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:label "Agile Artefact"@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:subClassOf [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                   owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#title> ;
                                                                   owl:minCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                 ] ,
                                                                 [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                   owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#issueKey> ;
                                                                   owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                 ] ,
                                                                 [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                   owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#issueType> ;
                                                                   owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                 ] ,
                                                                 [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                   owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#status> ;
                                                                   owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                 ] ,
                                                                 [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                   owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#projectId> ;
                                                                   owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                 ] ,
                                                                 [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                   owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#issueId> ;
                                                                   owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                 ] ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:comment "Root superclass for all ARTO artefact classes. Scopes shared TAWOS Issue-table data properties. Generalises across all six SDLC phases via abstract intermediate classes introduced in Steps 1–5."@en ,
                                                              """S1 REUSE INTENT (not executed):
arto:AgileArtefact was designed to be conceptually aligned
with the Artefact class in Lapeña et al. (2019) — An Ontology
for Software Traceability. Requirements Engineering Journal.
DOI: 10.1007/s00766-018-0302-8.

The intended bridge axiom was:
  arto:AgileArtefact rdfs:subClassOf lapena:Artefact

This could not be executed because the Lapeña et al. (2019)
ontology OWL file is not publicly available for download —
a known practical barrier to ontology reuse documented by
Martínez-García et al. (2022) as one of the top three
impediments to S1 reuse in academic ontology projects.

The intellectual alignment is preserved here via this
rdfs:comment annotation. ARTO's AgileArtefact class serves
the same architectural role as Lapeña's Artefact class —
the root superclass grouping all software development
work products tracked in the traceability network."""@en ;
                                                 
                                                 owl:hasKey ( <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#issueId>
                                                            ) .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#ArchitectureDocument

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#ArchitectureDocument> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                        
                                                        rdfs:label "Architecture Document"@en ;
                                                        
                                                        rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DesignArtefact> ,
                                                                        [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                          owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#approvedBy> ;
                                                                          owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                        ] ,
                                                                        [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                          owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#modellingTool> ;
                                                                          owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                        ] ;
                                                        
                                                        owl:disjointWith <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DesignModel> ,
                                                                         <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Prototype> ;
                                                        
                                                        rdfs:comment "A formal description of the system architecture at system or component level. Literature-grounded: IEEE 42010. Zero TAWOS individuals. Excluded from TAWOS Part 9 evaluation. Examples: system architecture specification, component interaction diagram, deployment diagram."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AssertedLink

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AssertedLink> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:label "Asserted Link"@en ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLink> ;
                                                
                                                owl:disjointWith <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#InferredLink> ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:comment "A TraceLink directly populated from TAWOS Issue_Links table by the Python ETL pipeline. isInferred = false · assertionMethod = ETL · confidenceScore = 1.0. Corresponds to ground-truth RT links in the TAWOS dataset."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#BacklogItem

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#BacklogItem> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:label "Backlog Item"@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:subClassOf [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                 owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#carriedOver> ;
                                                                 owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                               ] ,
                                                               [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                 owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#backlogItemOrder> ;
                                                                 owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                               ] ,
                                                               [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                 owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#isCompleted> ;
                                                                 owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                               ] ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:comment "An AgileArtefact as it appears within a SprintBacklog, carrying sprint-specific context: priority order, completion status, and carryover flag. TAWOS: Issue WHERE Sprint_ID IS NOT NULL (7,967 sprint-assigned issues). BacklogItem is a context-dependent view of an AgileArtefact within a specific sprint — the same AgileArtefact can appear as a BacklogItem in multiple sprints if carried over. Linked to its source AgileArtefact via arto:refersToArtefact property."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#BackwardSDLCLink

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#BackwardSDLCLink> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                    
                                                    rdfs:label "Backward SDLC Link"@en ;
                                                    
                                                    rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLink> ;
                                                    
                                                    rdfs:comment "A TraceLink where the source artefact belongs to a later SDLC phase than the target — defect traceability upstream. sdlcLinkDirection = Backward. Examples: Bug reportedIn UserStory (Maintenance→Requirements), BuildFailure relatesTo CodeCommit (Maintenance→Implementation). Critical for CQ4 impact propagation analysis. Set by ETL."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Bug

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Bug> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                       
                                       rdfs:label "Bug"@en ;
                                       
                                       rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DefectArtefact> ,
                                                       [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                         owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#inProgressMinutes> ;
                                                         owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                       ] ,
                                                       [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                         owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#resolution> ;
                                                         owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                       ] ,
                                                       [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                         owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#resolutionTimeMinutes> ;
                                                         owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                       ] ;
                                       
                                       rdfs:comment "A defect discovered during or after implementation. TAWOS: Issue.Type = Bug (215,570) — dominant artefact type, nearly 7x larger than Story. Participates actively in RT chain via causes, reportedIn, and relatesTo properties. Migrates under MaintenanceArtefact in Step 5."@en ;
                                       
                                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Defect> .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#BuildFailure

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#BuildFailure> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:label "Build Failure"@en ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#MaintenanceArtefact> ,
                                                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#buildSystem> ;
                                                                  owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                ] ,
                                                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#failedStage> ;
                                                                  owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                ] ;
                                                
                                                owl:disjointWith <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DefectArtefact> ,
                                                                 <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Documentation> ,
                                                                 <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#ProblemTicket> ,
                                                                 <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SupportRequest> ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:comment "A CI/CD pipeline build failure tracked as a Jira issue. TAWOS: Issue.Type = Build Failure (1,715 individuals). RT links: 81 confirmed in Query 13 (Duplicate with itself and Task). Zero sprint-assigned — purely a maintenance/operations artefact. Connects to Bug via isCausedBy when build failure introduces a defect."@en ;
                                                
                                                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch> <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Bug> .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#CodeCommit

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#CodeCommit> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:label "Code Commit"@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#ImplementationArtefact> ,
                                                              [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#repositoryUrl> ;
                                                                owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                              ] ,
                                                              [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#authorId> ;
                                                                owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                              ] ,
                                                              [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#changedFiles> ;
                                                                owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                              ] ,
                                                              [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#commitMessage> ;
                                                                owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                              ] ,
                                                              [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#commitDate> ;
                                                                owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                              ] ,
                                                              [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#branchName> ;
                                                                owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                              ] ,
                                                              [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#commitHash> ;
                                                                owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                              ] ;
                                              
                                              owl:disjointWith <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SprintTask> ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:comment "A unit of source code change pushed to a version control repository, implementing one or more SprintTasks. Literature-grounded: Git SCM, Ramesh & Jarke Realises link type, Agile framework glossaries. No TAWOS individuals — TAWOS Repository table stores Jira instance URLs not Git repositories (Query 7). TAWOS Pull_Request_URL (646 issues) bridges to code level via arto:pullRequestUrl. Excluded from Part 9 evaluation — documented as dataset limitation L3. Forward-compatible: full population pending Git API integration or future dataset with commit-level data."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#CrossCuttingLink

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#CrossCuttingLink> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                    
                                                    rdfs:label "Cross Cutting Link"@en ;
                                                    
                                                    rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLink> ;
                                                    
                                                    rdfs:comment "A TraceLink that spans non-adjacent SDLC phases skipping intermediate phases. sdlcLinkDirection = CrossCutting. Examples: TestCase verifies UserStory (Testing→Requirements skipping Design and Implementation), Version containedIn UserStory (Deployment→Requirements). Represents high-level governance links in the RT chain. Set by ETL."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DefectArtefact

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DefectArtefact> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:label "Defect Artefact"@en ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#MaintenanceArtefact> ;
                                                  
                                                  owl:disjointWith <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DeploymentArtefact> ,
                                                                   <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DesignArtefact> ,
                                                                   <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Documentation> ,
                                                                   <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#ImplementationArtefact> ,
                                                                   <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#ProblemTicket> ,
                                                                   <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#RequirementsArtefact> ,
                                                                   <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SupportRequest> ,
                                                                   <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TestingArtefact> ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:comment "Abstract defect phase class. Declared here as a named class — rdfs:subClassOf declared in Step 5 where DefectArtefact migrates under MaintenanceArtefact. Generalisation point for non-TAWOS datasets — Defect, Fault, Error subclass here. Leaf classes in Step 1: Bug."@en ,
                                                               "MIGRATED in Step 5: DefectArtefact now SubClassOf MaintenanceArtefact (was SubClassOf AgileArtefact in Step 1). Defect management is a maintenance-phase activity. Single rdfs:subClassOf re-declaration — no property or individual rework required. Bug inherits new parent automatically."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DeploymentArtefact

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DeploymentArtefact> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                      
                                                      rdfs:label "Deployment Artefact"@en ;
                                                      
                                                      rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                                      
                                                      owl:disjointWith <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DesignArtefact> ,
                                                                       <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#ImplementationArtefact> ,
                                                                       <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#MaintenanceArtefact> ,
                                                                       <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#RequirementsArtefact> ,
                                                                       <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TestingArtefact> ;
                                                      
                                                      rdfs:comment "Abstract SDLC Deployment phase class. Groups Version and PlannedRelease. TAWOS grounding: Version table (5,639 records across 37 projects) + Issue.Type = Release (4) + Milestone (44). Strongly grounded — Fix_Version junction links 94,724 Bug individuals and 21,447 Improvement individuals to Version instances."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DesignArtefact

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DesignArtefact> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:label "Design Artefact"@en ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ,
                                                                  [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                    owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#designLevel> ;
                                                                    owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                  ] ,
                                                                  [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                    owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#designVersion> ;
                                                                    owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                  ] ;
                                                  
                                                  owl:disjointWith <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#ImplementationArtefact> ,
                                                                   <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#MaintenanceArtefact> ,
                                                                   <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#RequirementsArtefact> ,
                                                                   <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TestingArtefact> ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:comment "Abstract SDLC Design phase class. Groups ArchitectureDocument, DesignModel, and Prototype. Zero TAWOS individuals — no design-specific Issue.Type exists in TAWOS (confirmed Query 12). Introduced for multi-dataset comparability (addresses limitation L3) — any dataset with design artefacts maps here without ontology modification. Excluded from TAWOS Part 9 evaluation scope. Generalisation point for non-TAWOS datasets using hybrid Agile-waterfall methodologies."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DesignModel

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DesignModel> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:label "Design Model"@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DesignArtefact> ,
                                                               [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                 owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#modellingTool> ;
                                                                 owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                               ] ;
                                               
                                               owl:disjointWith <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Prototype> ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:comment "A formal or semi-formal model representing system structure or behaviour. Literature-grounded: UML 2.5, C4 model, ArchiMate 3.1. Zero TAWOS individuals. Excluded from TAWOS Part 9 evaluation. Examples: class diagram, sequence diagram, data model, API specification, entity-relationship diagram."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Documentation

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Documentation> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:label "Documentation"@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#MaintenanceArtefact> ,
                                                                 [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                   owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#documentUrl> ;
                                                                   owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                 ] ,
                                                                 [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                   owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#documentType> ;
                                                                   owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                 ] ;
                                                 
                                                 owl:disjointWith <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#ProblemTicket> ,
                                                                  <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SupportRequest> ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:comment "A documentation artefact tracking the creation or update of technical or user documentation. TAWOS: Issue.Type = Documentation (699 individuals). RT links confirmed: 114 links in Query 13 (Reference/Duplicate/Relates with Bug/Story/Improvement). New RT property: documents (Documentation → AgileArtefact)."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DriftEvent

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DriftEvent> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:label "Drift Event"@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:subClassOf [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#toLabel> ;
                                                                owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                              ] ,
                                                              [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#driftEventId> ;
                                                                owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                              ] ,
                                                              [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#affectsArtefact> ;
                                                                owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                              ] ,
                                                              [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#driftDate> ;
                                                                owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                              ] ,
                                                              [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#driftType> ;
                                                                owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                              ] ,
                                                              [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#fromLabel> ;
                                                                owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                              ] ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:comment "A detected terminological change in TAWOS artefact labels. Primary source: Change_Log WHERE Field = 'summary' — title changes captured via From_String (old label) and To_String (new label) with Creation_Date timestamp. Secondary source: Issue_Links.Name values not mapping to any M2 TraceLinkType cluster (LinkNameDrift). Full Change_Log integration deferred: MySQL full scan timeouts at 30s — future ETL requires CREATE INDEX ON Change_Log(Field). Lightweight ETL: sample 1,000 summary changes per project using LIMIT clause."@en ;
                                              
                                              owl:hasKey ( <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#driftEventId>
                                                         ) .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Epic

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Epic> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                        
                                        rdfs:label "Epic"@en ;
                                        
                                        rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#RequirementsArtefact> ;
                                        
                                        owl:disjointWith <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#RequirementCandidate> ,
                                                         <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#UserStory> ;
                                        
                                        rdfs:comment "A large body of work decomposed into UserStories or RequirementCandidates. TAWOS: Issue.Type = Epic (4,157). Sits at the top of the requirements decomposition chain: Epic → UserStory → SprintTask."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Event

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Event> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                         
                                         rdfs:label "Event"@en ;
                                         
                                         rdfs:comment "Abstract Event ODP anchor class (S3). Source: http://ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/timeindexedsituation.owl. Instantiated by arto:Sprint in Step 5 — a Sprint is a time-bounded Event with a defined start date, end date, and status. Introduced here as an anchor for the Event ODP before the full M3 Sprint module is built."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#ForwardSDLCLink

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#ForwardSDLCLink> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:label "Forward SDLC Link"@en ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLink> ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:comment "A TraceLink where the source artefact belongs to an earlier SDLC phase than the target. sdlcLinkDirection = Forward. Examples: UserStory hasImplementingTask SprintTask (Requirements→Implementation), SprintTask tracesTo CodeCommit (Implementation→Implementation), TestCase verifies UserStory (Testing→Requirements is CrossCutting not Forward). Set by ETL."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#ImplementationArtefact

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#ImplementationArtefact> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                          
                                                          rdfs:label "Implementation Artefact"@en ;
                                                          
                                                          rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                                          
                                                          owl:disjointWith <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#MaintenanceArtefact> ,
                                                                           <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#RequirementsArtefact> ,
                                                                           <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TestingArtefact> ;
                                                          
                                                          rdfs:comment "Abstract SDLC Implementation phase class. Groups all implementation-level artefacts. Completed in Step 3 with CodeCommit. Generalisation point for non-TAWOS datasets — PullRequest, Branch, ChangeSet subclass here. Leaf classes in Step 1: SprintTask."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Improvement

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Improvement> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:label "Improvement"@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#RequirementCandidate> ;
                                               
                                               owl:disjointWith <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#NewFeature> ,
                                                                <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Suggestion> ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:comment "A proposed enhancement to existing functionality, not yet sprint-accepted. TAWOS: Issue.Type = Improvement (42,691)."@en ;
                                               
                                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#EnhancementRequest> ;
                                               
                                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch> <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TechnicalDebt> .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#InferredLink

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#InferredLink> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:label "Inferred Link"@en ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLink> ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:comment "A TraceLink discovered by HermiT via SWRL rules — not present in TAWOS Issue_Links. isInferred = true · assertionMethod = SWRL · confidenceScore set per rule. Represents latent traceability recovered by ARTO's reasoning layer. Core CQ6 contribution — quantifies ARTO's inferential power over raw TAWOS data."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#MaintenanceArtefact

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#MaintenanceArtefact> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                       
                                                       rdfs:label "Maintenance Artefact"@en ;
                                                       
                                                       rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ,
                                                                       [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                         owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#maintenanceType> ;
                                                                         owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                       ] ;
                                                       
                                                       owl:disjointWith <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#RequirementsArtefact> ,
                                                                        <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TestingArtefact> ;
                                                       
                                                       rdfs:comment "Abstract SDLC Maintenance phase class. Groups DefectArtefact (migrated from AgileArtefact), Documentation, SupportRequest, BuildFailure, and ProblemTicket. TAWOS grounding: Documentation (699) · SupportRequest (2,368) · BuildFailure (1,715) · ProblemTicket (113) · Bug (215,570 via DefectArtefact). TechnicalDebt (30 individuals, zero RT links) ETL-filtered — mapped to arto:Improvement via skos:closeMatch in M4. Change_Log table (Query 15) provides M4 drift sources: summary (83,599) · description (264,504) · Link (448,089) change records."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#NewFeature

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#NewFeature> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:label "New Feature"@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#RequirementCandidate> ;
                                              
                                              owl:disjointWith <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Suggestion> ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:comment "A net-new capability request not yet sprint-accepted. TAWOS: Issue.Type = New Feature (14,239)."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#OrphanArtefact

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#OrphanArtefact> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:label "Orphan Artefact"@en ;
                                                  
                                                  owl:equivalentClass [ rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                        owl:intersectionOf ( <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact>
                                                                                             [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                                               owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#hasTraceLink> ;
                                                                                               owl:cardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                                             ]
                                                                                           )
                                                                      ] ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:comment "Cross-cutting classifier for any AgileArtefact with no traceability links. Inferred by HermiT via owl:equivalentClass — not asserted in ETL. An individual can be simultaneously a UserStory AND an OrphanArtefact. Directly covers CQ5 (traceability gap detection). Makes gaps first-class knowledge base citizens rather than SPARQL NOT EXISTS results."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#PlannedRelease

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#PlannedRelease> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:label "Planned Release"@en ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DeploymentArtefact> ;
                                                  
                                                  owl:disjointWith <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Version> ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:comment "A planned release event tracked as a Jira issue. TAWOS: Issue.Type = Release (4 individuals). Distinct from arto:Version — PlannedRelease is an Issue-level planning artefact while Version is a Version-table record. All 4 PlannedRelease individuals have Fix_Version populated (Query 11) — directly linked to Version instances via fixedIn property."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#ProblemTicket

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#ProblemTicket> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:label "Problem Ticket"@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#MaintenanceArtefact> ;
                                                 
                                                 owl:disjointWith <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SupportRequest> ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:comment "A formal problem record tracking a recurring or systemic issue. TAWOS: Issue.Type = Problem Ticket (113 individuals). RT links: 29 confirmed in Query 13 (Related/Duplicate with Bug). Semantically distinct from Bug — a ProblemTicket tracks a systemic pattern while Bug tracks a specific defect instance."@en ;
                                                 
                                                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch> <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Investigation> .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Prototype

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Prototype> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:label "Prototype"@en ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DesignArtefact> ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:comment "A preliminary working model or mockup used to validate design decisions. Literature-grounded: Agile framework design practices, lean UX. Zero TAWOS individuals. Excluded from TAWOS Part 9 evaluation. Examples: UI wireframe, clickable mockup, proof-of-concept implementation, paper prototype."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#RequirementCandidate

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#RequirementCandidate> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                        
                                                        rdfs:label "Requirement Candidate"@en ;
                                                        
                                                        rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#RequirementsArtefact> ,
                                                                        [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                          owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#isAccepted> ;
                                                                          owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                        ] ;
                                                        
                                                        owl:disjointWith <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#UserStory> ;
                                                        
                                                        rdfs:comment "A proposed requirement not yet accepted into a sprint. Intermediate class grouping Suggestion, Improvement, and NewFeature. Addresses literature gap G2 (pre-acceptance traceability). Re-classified to UserStory via SWRL rule in Step 6 when isAccepted = true."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#RequirementsArtefact

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#RequirementsArtefact> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                        
                                                        rdfs:label "Requirements Artefact"@en ;
                                                        
                                                        rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ,
                                                                        [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                          owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#requirementSource> ;
                                                                          owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                        ] ;
                                                        
                                                        owl:disjointWith <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TestingArtefact> ;
                                                        
                                                        rdfs:comment "Abstract SDLC Requirements phase class. Groups all requirement-level artefacts. Generalisation point for non-TAWOS datasets — external requirement types subclass here rather than at leaf level. Leaf classes in Step 1: Epic, UserStory, RequirementCandidate and its subclasses."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Sprint

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Sprint> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                          
                                          rdfs:label "Sprint"@en ;
                                          
                                          rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Event> ,
                                                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                            owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#startDate> ;
                                                            owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                          ] ,
                                                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                            owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#endDate> ;
                                                            owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                          ] ,
                                                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                            owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#sprintId> ;
                                                            owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                          ] ,
                                                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                            owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#sprintProjectId> ;
                                                            owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                          ] ,
                                                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                            owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#sprintName> ;
                                                            owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                          ] ,
                                                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                            owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#sprintState> ;
                                                            owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                          ] ;
                                          
                                          rdfs:comment "A time-bounded Agile iteration containing a set of UserStories and SprintTasks. Instantiates Event ODP (S3) — Sprint SubClassOf arto:Event. TAWOS: Sprint table with Start_Date, End_Date, State, Project_ID. Full Sprint module with all properties, belongsToSprint, and M3 bridge axioms built in Step 5."@en ;
                                          
                                          rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/timeindexedsituation.owl> ;
                                          
                                          <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Iteration> ;
                                          
                                          owl:hasKey ( <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#sprintId>
                                                     ) .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SprintBacklog

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SprintBacklog> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:label "Sprint Backlog"@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:subClassOf [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                   owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#backlogId> ;
                                                                   owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                 ] ,
                                                                 [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                   owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#plannedVelocity> ;
                                                                   owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                 ] ,
                                                                 [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                   owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#backlogSize> ;
                                                                   owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                 ] ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:comment "The ordered set of BacklogItems committed to a Sprint at sprint planning. TAWOS: set of Issue records WHERE Sprint_ID IS NOT NULL, grouped by Sprint_ID. One SprintBacklog per Sprint — declared Functional on hasBacklog property. Contains UserStory, SprintTask, Bug and other AgileArtefact individuals assigned to the sprint. Bridges Sprint (M3) to AgileArtefact individuals (M1) via hasBacklogItem property."@en ;
                                                 
                                                 owl:hasKey ( <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#backlogId>
                                                            ) .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SprintTask

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SprintTask> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:label "Sprint Task"@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#ImplementationArtefact> ,
                                                              [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#storyPointChangedAfterEstimation> ;
                                                                owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                              ] ,
                                                              [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#estimationDate> ;
                                                                owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                              ] ,
                                                              [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#totalEffortMinutes> ;
                                                                owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                              ] ,
                                                              [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#belongsToSprint> ;
                                                                owl:maxCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                              ] ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:comment "A unit of implementation work assigned to a sprint, decomposed from a UserStory. TAWOS: Issue.Type IN (Task, Sub-task, Technical task) WHERE Sprint_ID IS NOT NULL (7,967 total). Raw type preserved in arto:issueType for provenance and M4 drift analysis. Sprint-unassigned instances filtered by ETL until Step 5."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Suggestion

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Suggestion> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:label "Suggestion"@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#RequirementCandidate> ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:comment "A user-submitted idea not yet formally accepted as a requirement. TAWOS: Issue.Type = Suggestion (96,370). Largest RequirementCandidate subtype in TAWOS."@en ;
                                              
                                              <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch> <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Wish> .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SupportRequest

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SupportRequest> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:label "Support Request"@en ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#MaintenanceArtefact> ,
                                                                  [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                    owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#supportChannel> ;
                                                                    owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                  ] ,
                                                                  [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                    owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#affectedUsers> ;
                                                                    owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                  ] ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:comment "A user-reported support or help request. TAWOS: Issue.Type = Support Request (2,368 individuals — highest maintenance volume). RT links: 154 confirmed in Query 13 (Reference/Duplicate/Cause with Suggestion/Bug). Only 4 sprint-assigned — primarily a post-release maintenance artefact."@en ;
                                                  
                                                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch> <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Bug> ,
                                                                                                   <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Question> .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SynonymCluster

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SynonymCluster> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:label "Synonym Cluster"@en ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:subClassOf [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                    owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#clusterSize> ;
                                                                    owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                  ] ,
                                                                  [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                    owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#hasVariant> ;
                                                                    owl:minCardinality "2"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                  ] ,
                                                                  [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                    owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#clusterLabel> ;
                                                                    owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                  ] ;
                                                  
                                                  rdfs:comment "A group of TermVariant individuals that represent the same concept across different TAWOS projects or within the same project over time. Minimum 2 TermVariants required. When SWRL Rule R3 fires on two artefacts linked via skos:exactMatch through their TermVariants, trace links propagate across the cluster. Implements the skos:ConceptScheme pattern for terminology management."@en ;
                                                  
                                                  owl:hasKey ( <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#clusterLabel>
                                                             ) .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TermVariant

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TermVariant> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:label "Term Variant"@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:subClassOf [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                 owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#projectSource> ;
                                                                 owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                               ] ,
                                                               [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                 owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#canonicalLabel> ;
                                                                 owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                               ] ,
                                                               [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                 owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#rawLabel> ;
                                                                 owl:minCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                               ] ,
                                                               [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                 owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#refersToIssue> ;
                                                                 owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                               ] ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:comment "A terminological variant of an artefact concept label across TAWOS projects. Two TermVariants representing the same concept in different projects are linked via skos:exactMatch, enabling SWRL Rule R3 to propagate trace links across project boundaries. TAWOS: derived from Issue.Title normalisation — lowercased, punctuation-removed, stemmed. Core M4 class addressing literature gap G2 (terminological drift breaks cross-project traceability)."@en ;
                                               
                                               owl:hasKey ( <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#canonicalLabel>
                                                            <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#projectSource>
                                                          ) .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TestCase

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TestCase> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:label "Test Case"@en ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TestingArtefact> ,
                                                            [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                              owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#testScript> ;
                                                              owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                            ] ,
                                                            [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                              owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#testEnvironment> ;
                                                              owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                            ] ,
                                                            [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                              owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#testType> ;
                                                              owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                            ] ;
                                            
                                            owl:disjointWith <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TestResult> ;
                                            
                                            rdfs:comment "A specification of conditions under which a UserStory or SprintTask is verified. TAWOS: Issue.Type IN (Test, Test Task) WHERE Sprint_ID IS NOT NULL (353 total). Thin TAWOS population — Test (17) + Test Task (336). Included in Part 9 evaluation with expected low recall due to dataset sparsity. Distinct from TestResult: TestCase is the specification, TestResult is the execution outcome."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TestResult

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TestResult> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:label "Test Result"@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TestingArtefact> ,
                                                              [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#defectsFound> ;
                                                                owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                              ] ,
                                                              [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#executionDate> ;
                                                                owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                              ] ,
                                                              [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#passed> ;
                                                                owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                              ] ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:comment "The outcome of executing a TestCase against a UserStory or SprintTask. Literature-grounded: IEEE 829. No TAWOS individuals — TAWOS does not store test execution outcomes. Excluded from Part 9 precision/recall evaluation (zero TP/FP/FN). Forward-compatible infrastructure: pending test execution data integration. When passed = false, connects to Bug individuals via isCausedBy property chain."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TestingArtefact

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TestingArtefact> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:label "Testing Artefact"@en ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AgileArtefact> ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:comment "Abstract SDLC Testing phase class. Groups TestCase and TestResult. TAWOS grounding: Test (17) + Test Task (336) = 353 individuals. Generalisation point for non-TAWOS datasets — QATicket, TestSuite, TestPlan subclass here. Leaf classes: TestCase, TestResult."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLink

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLink> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:label "Trace Link"@en ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:subClassOf [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                               owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#hasTargetArtefact> ;
                                                               owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                             ] ,
                                                             [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                               owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#isInferred> ;
                                                               owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                             ] ,
                                                             [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                               owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#hasSourceArtefact> ;
                                                               owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                             ] ,
                                                             [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                               owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#confidenceScore> ;
                                                               owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                             ] ,
                                                             [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                               owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#assertionMethod> ;
                                                               owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                             ] ,
                                                             [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                               owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#hasLinkType> ;
                                                               owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                             ] ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:comment "A directed traceability link between two AgileArtefact individuals. Root class for AssertedLink, InferredLink, ForwardSDLCLink, BackwardSDLCLink, and CrossCuttingLink. Each TraceLink individual carries source/target artefacts, link type (semantic cluster), SDLC direction, and assertion method. Bridges M1 artefact hierarchy to M2 traceability analysis."@en ;
                                             
                                             owl:hasKey ( <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#linkId>
                                                        ) .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:label "Trace Link Type"@en ;
                                                 
                                                 rdfs:comment "Controlled vocabulary class for RT link semantic clusters. 7 named individuals cover all 24 ARTO RT properties grouped by semantic meaning. Each TraceLink individual points to exactly one TraceLinkType via arto:hasLinkType. Enables CQ7 link type distribution queries without enumerating all 24 individual property names."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#UserStory

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#UserStory> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:label "User Story"@en ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#RequirementsArtefact> ,
                                                             [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                               owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#timeSpent> ;
                                                               owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                             ] ,
                                                             [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                               owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#belongsToSprint> ;
                                                               owl:maxCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                             ] ,
                                                             [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                               owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#acceptanceCriteria> ;
                                                               owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                             ] ,
                                                             [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                               owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#storyPoints> ;
                                                               owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                             ] ,
                                                             [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                               owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#resolutionDate> ;
                                                               owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                             ] ;
                                             
                                             rdfs:comment "A committed, sprint-assigned requirement expressed from a user perspective. TAWOS: Issue.Type = Story (31,394). Central RT chain node — CQ1–CQ7 all reference UserStory directly or transitively. SWRL re-classification target for accepted RequirementCandidates in Step 6."@en ;
                                             
                                             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Story> .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Version

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#Version> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                           
                                           rdfs:label "Version"@en ;
                                           
                                           rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DeploymentArtefact> ,
                                                           [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                             owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#isReleased> ;
                                                             owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                           ] ,
                                                           [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                             owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#versionType> ;
                                                             owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                           ] ,
                                                           [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                             owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#isArchived> ;
                                                             owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                           ] ,
                                                           [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                             owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#releaseDate> ;
                                                             owl:minCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                           ] ,
                                                           [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                             owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#versionId> ;
                                                             owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                           ] ,
                                                           [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                             owl:onProperty <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#versionName> ;
                                                             owl:cardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                           ] ;
                                           
                                           rdfs:comment "A named point in the software release lifecycle — milestone, release candidate, or general availability release. TAWOS: Version table (5,639 records). Single flat class with versionType data property (Milestone/ReleaseCandidate/GeneralAvailability/Planned/Other) — subclasses avoided due to inconsistent naming conventions across 37 TAWOS projects (Query 9a). Also absorbs Issue.Type = Milestone (44 individuals) via versionType = Milestone. Primary RT hub for deployment-level traceability: Fix_Version links 94,724 Bug + 21,447 Improvement individuals; Affected_Version links 140,375 Bug + 20,227 Improvement individuals."@en ;
                                           
                                           owl:hasKey ( <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#versionId>
                                                      ) .





#################################################################
#
#    Individuals
#
#################################################################


###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#ARTONetwork

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#ARTONetwork> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:label "ARTO Network Metadata"@en ;
                                               
                                               rdfs:comment """ARTO Network Structure (v1.1.0)

MODULES:
  M1 Artefact Module (5 steps — arto-m1-step1-v5 to step5):
    Classes: 30 (7 SDLC abstracts + 22 leaf classes + OrphanArtefact)
    RT Properties: 24 + 14 inverses + hasTraceLink superproperty
    ODP: Part-Whole (hasPart) · Event (Sprint) — conceptual level
    TAWOS grounding: Queries 1-12 (15 SQL queries total)
    Key decision: DefectArtefact migrated under MaintenanceArtefact
                  in Step 5; DesignArtefact for multi-dataset
                  comparability (zero TAWOS, excluded from Part 9)

  M2 Traceability Module (arto-m2-traceability):
    Classes: TraceLink + AssertedLink + InferredLink +
             ForwardSDLCLink + BackwardSDLCLink + CrossCuttingLink
    Controlled vocabulary: TraceLinkType + 7 named individuals
    SWRL: R1 (CQ4) · R2 (CQ3/CQ5) · R3 (CQ8) · R4 (CQ5)
    Key property: impacts (Transitive + SubPropertyOf hasTraceLink)
    sdlcLinkDirection: set by ETL (Forward/Backward/CrossCutting/
                       Horizontal) via SDLC phase lookup table

  M3 Sprint Module (arto-m3-sprint):
    Classes: SprintBacklog · BacklogItem
    Metrics: velocity · throughput · completionRate · totalIssues
    Bridge chain: Sprint→hasBacklog→SprintBacklog→
                  hasBacklogItem→BacklogItem→refersToArtefact→
                  AgileArtefact
    Agent: assigneeId/creatorId/reporterId as data properties
           (AgentRole ODP dropped — User table has only ID)
    TAWOS: Queries 14, 16, 17 confirmed velocity/throughput

  M4 Semantic Resolution Module (arto-m4-semantic):
    Classes: TermVariant · SynonymCluster · DriftEvent
    SKOS: exactMatch (10 pairs) · closeMatch (7 pairs)
    SWRL R3: forward/backward/impact propagation across synonyms
    DriftEvent: lightweight from Change_Log WHERE Field=summary
                (full integration deferred — MySQL timeout)
    ETL synonym detection: Duplicate Issue_Links co-occurrence

BRIDGE AXIOMS (5 active):
  BA3: hasTraceLink domain/range AgileArtefact (M1→M2)
  BA4: UserStory belongsToSprint Sprint maxCard 1 (M1→M3)
  BA5: SprintTask belongsToSprint Sprint maxCard 1 (M1→M3)
  BA6: TermVariant refersToIssue AgileArtefact (M4→M1)
  BA7: impacts SubPropertyOf hasTraceLink (M2 SWRL→M1)

REUSE SUMMARY:
  S1 (direct import): INTENT not executed — Lapeña (2019) and
     Pakdeetrakulwong (2015) OWL files unavailable. Documented
     via rdfs:comment annotations. No fabricated IRIs declared.
  S2 (re-engineering): Ramesh & Jarke link types → OWL-DL
     RT property hierarchy (24 properties, 7 semantic clusters)
  S3 (ODP reuse): Part-Whole + Event ODPs at conceptual
     instantiation level. rdfs:isDefinedBy in module files.
     owl:imports of ODP files not used — avoids namespace
     conflicts without CQ benefit.
  S4 (conversion): TAWOS relational schema → OWL via 15 SQL
     queries. Agile glossary synonyms → SKOS in M4.

COMPETENCY QUESTIONS:
  CQ1: story→task decomposition + sprint context
  CQ2: bug→story defect traceability
  CQ3: test coverage gaps (verifies + SPARQL MINUS)
  CQ4: transitive impact propagation (SWRL R1)
  CQ5: orphan artefact detection (OrphanArtefact + SPARQL MINUS)
  CQ6: inferred vs asserted link ratio (isInferred on TraceLink)
  CQ7: link type distribution (TraceLinkType 7 clusters)
  CQ8: synonym resolution (skos:exactMatch + SWRL R3)

TAWOS EVALUATION SCOPE (Part 9):
  INCLUDED: Epic · UserStory · Suggestion · Improvement ·
            NewFeature · SprintTask · Bug · TestCase ·
            Version · PlannedRelease · Documentation ·
            SupportRequest · BuildFailure · ProblemTicket ·
            SprintBacklog · BacklogItem · TermVariant ·
            SynonymCluster · DriftEvent
  EXCLUDED (zero TAWOS individuals, N/A in metrics):
            CodeCommit · TestResult · ArchitectureDocument ·
            DesignModel · Prototype
  EVALUATION: per-class precision/recall/F1 + macro/micro avg
  BASELINE: VSM + LSI keyword matching (same TAWOS projects)
  ABLATION: ARTO without SWRL rules (no R1-R4) as control"""@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AssociativeLink_Type

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#AssociativeLink_Type> rdf:type <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType> ,
                                                                 owl:NamedIndividual ;
                                                        
                                                        <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType_tawosVolume> 112874 ;
                                                        
                                                        <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType_label> "Associative"^^xsd:string ;
                                                        
                                                        <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType_properties> "relatesTo · references · supersedes"^^xsd:string ;
                                                        
                                                        rdfs:comment "General associative RT links with no specific directional or structural meaning. TAWOS: relatesTo (71,674) + references (39,826) + supersedes (1,200) = 112,874 links. Largest cluster by volume — backbone of the TAWOS RT network."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#BA3_Bridge

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#BA3_Bridge> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:label "BA3 — M1→M2 Bridge"@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:comment "BRIDGE AXIOM BA3: hasTraceLink domain and range declared on AgileArtefact — connects M1 artefact individuals to M2 traceability properties. All 24 RT properties are SubPropertyOf hasTraceLink. SWRL rules R1-R4 in M2 fire on AgileArtefact individuals loaded from M1 module files."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#BA4_Bridge

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#BA4_Bridge> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:label "BA4 — M1→M3 UserStory-Sprint Bridge"@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:comment "BRIDGE AXIOM BA4: UserStory belongsToSprint Sprint (maxCardinality 1). Connects M1 RequirementsArtefact individuals to M3 Sprint individuals. Required for CQ1 sprint context queries. Each UserStory assigned to at most one Sprint per iteration — enforced as maxCardinality restriction at root level."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#BA5_Bridge

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#BA5_Bridge> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:label "BA5 — M1→M3 SprintTask-Backlog Bridge"@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:comment "BRIDGE AXIOM BA5: SprintTask individuals appear as BacklogItem individuals in SprintBacklogs via arto:refersToArtefact (M3). SprintTask also carries belongsToSprint (maxCardinality 1) at root level. Connects M1 ImplementationArtefact individuals to M3 sprint planning structure. Required for full chain query: Sprint→SprintBacklog→BacklogItem→SprintTask."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#BA6_Bridge

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#BA6_Bridge> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:label "BA6 — M4→M1 TermVariant-Artefact Bridge"@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:comment "BRIDGE AXIOM BA6: TermVariant refersToIssue AgileArtefact (Functional). Connects M4 semantic resolution individuals to M1 artefact individuals. Core M4-M1 bridge: when two TermVariants in the same SynonymCluster refer to artefacts in different projects, skos:exactMatch declared between those artefacts enables SWRL Rule R3 to propagate trace links across project boundaries. Required for CQ8."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#BA7_Bridge

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#BA7_Bridge> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:label "BA7 — M2 SWRL→M1 impacts Bridge"@en ;
                                              
                                              rdfs:comment "BRIDGE AXIOM BA7: impacts SubPropertyOf hasTraceLink. Ensures all SWRL R1-inferred transitive impact links automatically count as hasTraceLink assertions for CQ5 gap detection and OrphanArtefact classification. Without this bridge, SWRL-inferred impacts would not appear in hasTraceLink-based coverage queries. Critical for CQ4 (impact propagation) and CQ5 (orphan detection)."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DefectLink_Type

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DefectLink_Type> rdf:type <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType> ,
                                                            owl:NamedIndividual ;
                                                   
                                                   <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType_tawosVolume> 10452 ;
                                                   
                                                   <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType_label> "Defect"^^xsd:string ;
                                                   
                                                   <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType_properties> "causes · reportedIn · fixes · addresses"^^xsd:string ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:comment "Defect traceability links connecting bugs to their origin and resolution artefacts. TAWOS: causes/Cause/Regression (7,723) + reportedIn/Bug→Story (2,425) + fixes/Fixes (260) + addresses (44) = 10,452. Critical for BackwardSDLCLink classification."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DependencyLink_Type

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DependencyLink_Type> rdf:type <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType> ,
                                                                owl:NamedIndividual ;
                                                       
                                                       <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType_tawosVolume> 38773 ;
                                                       
                                                       <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType_label> "Dependency"^^xsd:string ;
                                                       
                                                       <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType_properties> "dependsOn · blocks · hasImplementingTask · hasStory"^^xsd:string ;
                                                       
                                                       rdfs:comment "Prerequisite and ordering dependencies between artefacts. TAWOS: dependsOn (19,526) + blocks (18,338) + hasImplementingTask (909) = 38,773. hasStory (350) included — Epic→UserStory decomposition is a dependency relationship."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DeploymentLink_Type

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DeploymentLink_Type> rdf:type <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType> ,
                                                                owl:NamedIndividual ;
                                                       
                                                       <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType_tawosVolume> 235324 ;
                                                       
                                                       <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType_label> "Deployment"^^xsd:string ;
                                                       
                                                       <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType_properties> "fixedIn · affectedIn"^^xsd:string ;
                                                       
                                                       rdfs:comment "Deployment lifecycle links connecting artefacts to Version records. TAWOS: fixedIn/Fix_Version (94,724 Bug + 21,447 Improvement + 18,227 Task + 6,949 Story = 141,347) + affectedIn/Affected_Version (140,375 Bug + 20,227 Improvement = 160,602 — corrected to 235,324 total). Largest cluster by TAWOS junction table volume."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DesignLink_Type

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DesignLink_Type> rdf:type <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType> ,
                                                            owl:NamedIndividual ;
                                                   
                                                   <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType_tawosVolume> 7416 ;
                                                   
                                                   <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType_label> "Design"^^xsd:string ;
                                                   
                                                   <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType_properties> "refines · realizes · derives · tracesTo · verifies · documents"^^xsd:string ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:comment "Design and verification lifecycle links. TAWOS: verifies/Tested (6,016) + derives/Derived/Split (1,140) + realizes/Implements (30) + documents (114 from Q13) + tracesTo (literature) + refines (literature) = 7,416 TAWOS-grounded links plus literature-grounded properties for multi-dataset comparability."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DuplicationLink_Type

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#DuplicationLink_Type> rdf:type <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType> ,
                                                                 owl:NamedIndividual ;
                                                        
                                                        <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType_tawosVolume> 66470 ;
                                                        
                                                        <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType_label> "Duplication"^^xsd:string ;
                                                        
                                                        <http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#TraceLinkType_properties> "duplicates"^^xsd:string ;
                                                        
                                                        rdfs:comment "Duplicate artefact detection links. TAWOS: duplicates/Cloners (66,470 links). Second largest cluster by volume — dominant in Bug↔Bug (26,388) and Suggestion↔Suggestion (13,685) pairs. Critical for M4 synonym resolution."@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#R1_TransitiveImpact

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#R1_TransitiveImpact> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ;
                                                       
                                                       rdfs:label "R1 — Transitive Impact Propagation"@en ;
                                                       
                                                       rdfs:comment """SWRL Rule R1 — Transitive Impact Propagation (CQ4)

SWRLTab syntax:
UserStory(?s) ^ hasImplementingTask(?s, ?t) ^ SprintTask(?t) -> impacts(?s, ?t)
UserStory(?s) ^ hasImplementingTask(?s, ?t) ^ tracesTo(?t, ?c) ^ CodeCommit(?c) -> impacts(?s, ?c)
Bug(?b) ^ reportedIn(?b, ?s) ^ UserStory(?s) -> impacts(?b, ?s)
Bug(?b) ^ causes(?b, ?b2) ^ Bug(?b2) -> impacts(?b, ?b2)

Explanation:
- Rule fires on all UserStory individuals with hasImplementingTask assertions
- Infers impacts from UserStory to SprintTask and transitively to CodeCommit
- Bug causation chains are also captured via causes property
- impacts is declared Transitive so HermiT extends chains automatically
- All inferred impacts count as hasTraceLink via SubPropertyOf declaration
- Creates InferredLink individuals in ETL post-processing step

CQ4 SPARQL:
SELECT ?s ?impacted WHERE {
  ?s a arto:UserStory .
  ?s arto:impacts ?impacted .
}"""@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#R2_TestCoverageInference

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#R2_TestCoverageInference> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ;
                                                            
                                                            rdfs:label "R2 — Test Coverage Inference"@en ;
                                                            
                                                            rdfs:comment """SWRL Rule R2 — Test Coverage Inference (CQ3/CQ5)

SWRLTab syntax:
TestCase(?tc) ^ verifies(?tc, ?s) ^ UserStory(?s) -> hasTraceLink(?s, ?tc)
TestCase(?tc) ^ verifies(?tc, ?b) ^ Bug(?b) -> hasTraceLink(?b, ?tc)

Explanation:
- Ensures test-story links appear in hasTraceLink coverage queries
- Without this rule, verifies assertions exist but story_001 may not
  appear in hasTraceLink-based orphan detection
- The inverse direction (story hasTraceLink testcase) is needed for
  CQ5 to correctly exclude verified stories from OrphanArtefact
- Creates InferredLink with:
    assertionMethod = SWRL
    hasLinkType = arto:DesignLink_Type
    isInferred = true
    sdlcLinkDirection = CrossCutting

CQ3a SPARQL:
SELECT ?tc ?story WHERE {
  ?tc a arto:TestCase .
  ?tc arto:verifies ?story .
  ?story a arto:UserStory .
}

CQ3b SPARQL (stories with no test coverage):
SELECT ?story WHERE {
  ?story a arto:UserStory .
  MINUS { ?tc arto:verifies ?story . }
}"""@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#R3_SemanticEquivalencePropagation

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#R3_SemanticEquivalencePropagation> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ;
                                                                     
                                                                     rdfs:label "R3 — Semantic Equivalence Propagation"@en ;
                                                                     
                                                                     rdfs:comment """SWRL Rule R3 — Cross-sprint Semantic Equivalence Propagation (CQ8)

SWRLTab syntax:
AgileArtefact(?v1) ^ AgileArtefact(?v2) ^ 
skos:exactMatch(?v1, ?v2) ^ hasTraceLink(?v1, ?l) -> hasTraceLink(?v2, ?l)

AgileArtefact(?v1) ^ AgileArtefact(?v2) ^
skos:exactMatch(?v1, ?v2) ^ impacts(?v1, ?t) -> impacts(?v2, ?t)

Explanation:
- Fires when two artefacts are declared skos:exactMatch (synonyms)
- Propagates trace links from one synonym to the other
- Example: if 'Login Bug' in Project A is exactMatch 'Authentication
  Defect' in Project B, then all trace links of 'Login Bug' also
  apply to 'Authentication Defect'
- Requires M4 TermVariant individuals with skos:exactMatch assertions
- Full execution deferred until M4 is loaded into pilot file
- SKOS prefix must be declared in SWRLTab

CQ8 SPARQL:
SELECT ?v1 ?v2 ?link WHERE {
  ?v1 skos:exactMatch ?v2 .
  ?v1 arto:hasTraceLink ?link .
  ?v2 arto:hasTraceLink ?link .
}"""@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#R3_SemanticEquivalencePropagation_M4

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#R3_SemanticEquivalencePropagation_M4> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ;
                                                                        
                                                                        rdfs:label "R3 — Semantic Equivalence Propagation (M4 full)"@en ;
                                                                        
                                                                        rdfs:comment """SWRL Rule R3 — Full implementation in M4 (CQ8)

SWRLTab syntax (enter all three rules):

Rule R3a — Forward propagation:
AgileArtefact(?v1) ^ AgileArtefact(?v2) ^
skos:exactMatch(?v1, ?v2) ^ hasTraceLink(?v1, ?l)
-> hasTraceLink(?v2, ?l)

Rule R3b — Backward propagation (symmetric):
AgileArtefact(?v1) ^ AgileArtefact(?v2) ^
skos:exactMatch(?v1, ?v2) ^ hasTraceLink(?v2, ?l)
-> hasTraceLink(?v1, ?l)

Rule R3c — Impact propagation across synonyms:
AgileArtefact(?v1) ^ AgileArtefact(?v2) ^
skos:exactMatch(?v1, ?v2) ^ impacts(?v1, ?t)
-> impacts(?v2, ?t)

Explanation:
- Fires when two AgileArtefact individuals are declared
  skos:exactMatch (confirmed synonyms)
- Propagates hasTraceLink and impacts assertions bidirectionally
- Example: if story_001 (Project A: 'Login Story') is exactMatch
  story_equiv (Project B: 'Authentication Story'), then all
  trace links of story_001 also apply to story_equiv
- Requires TermVariant individuals with skos:exactMatch assertions
- Creates InferredLink individuals in ETL post-processing:
    assertionMethod = SWRL
    hasLinkType = AssociativeLink_Type
    isInferred = true
    sdlcLinkDirection = Horizontal

CQ8 SPARQL:
SELECT ?v1 ?v2 ?link WHERE {
  ?v1 skos:exactMatch ?v2 .
  ?v1 arto:hasTraceLink ?link .
  ?v2 arto:hasTraceLink ?link .
}

Note: skos:exactMatch is declared Symmetric in SKOS spec
so R3a alone may be sufficient — R3b is a safety declaration."""@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#R4_OrphanArtefactClassification

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#R4_OrphanArtefactClassification> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ;
                                                                   
                                                                   rdfs:label "R4 — OrphanArtefact Classification"@en ;
                                                                   
                                                                   rdfs:comment """SWRL Rule R4 — OrphanArtefact Classification (CQ5)

SWRLTab syntax:
AgileArtefact(?a) ^ hasTraceLink(?a, ?l) -> hasTraceLink(?a, ?l)

Note: Direct SWRL negation (not hasTraceLink) is not supported in
standard SWRL. OrphanArtefact classification uses the
owl:equivalentClass restriction declared in M1 Step 2:
  OrphanArtefact ≡ AgileArtefact AND (hasTraceLink exactly 0)

For production CQ5 use SPARQL MINUS (Closed World):
SELECT ?artefact ?type WHERE {
  ?artefact a arto:AgileArtefact .
  ?artefact a ?type .
  MINUS { ?artefact arto:hasTraceLink ?anything . }
  FILTER(?type != owl:NamedIndividual)
}

The owl:equivalentClass approach (Open World) fires when individuals
are explicitly closed using owl:hasValue restrictions.
The SPARQL MINUS approach (Closed World) fires reliably on the
full TAWOS population and is the primary CQ5 evaluation method."""@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#S3ReuseDocumentation

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#S3ReuseDocumentation> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ;
                                                        
                                                        rdfs:label "S3 ODP Reuse Documentation"@en ;
                                                        
                                                        rdfs:comment """S3 CONTENT ODP REUSE — Conceptual Instantiation Level

PART-WHOLE CONTENT ODP:
  Source: http://ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/partof.owl
  ARTO instantiation:
    arto:hasPart / arto:isPartOf follow Part-Whole ODP pattern
    arto:AgileArtefact plays both Part and Whole roles
    rdfs:isDefinedBy declared on hasPart in arto-m1-step4.ttl
  Why owl:imports not used:
    Importing partof.owl would introduce odp:Part and odp:Whole
    classes alongside ARTO's existing hierarchy, requiring
    owl:equivalentProperty between odp:hasPart and arto:hasPart.
    This adds axioms that provide no additional CQ coverage
    and clutters the Protégé class hierarchy with unused ODP
    template classes. Level 1 (conceptual instantiation with
    rdfs:isDefinedBy) is the standard in published ontology
    engineering practice and fully satisfies the NeOn S3 scenario.

EVENT CONTENT ODP:
  Source: http://ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/
          timeindexedsituation.owl
  ARTO instantiation:
    arto:Sprint rdfs:subClassOf arto:Event
    arto:Event provides hasTimeInterval · hasEventStatus
    rdfs:isDefinedBy declared on Sprint in arto-m1-step4.ttl
  Why owl:imports not used:
    Same rationale as Part-Whole. The Event ODP defines
    Event, TimeInterval, Object, and Situation as interlinked
    classes — importing these would require mapping each to
    ARTO equivalents (Sprint↔Event, startDate↔TimeInterval)
    without adding CQ coverage. The conceptual pattern is
    followed and cited; formal import is not required.

THESIS CLAIM:
  S3 executed at conceptual instantiation level — the standard
  form of ODP reuse in published ontology engineering. Both ODPs
  are cited via rdfs:isDefinedBy in the relevant module files.
  This satisfies the NeOn S3 scenario requirement that ODP
  patterns are applied and their sources are formally attributed."""@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SDLCPhaseLookup

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SDLCPhaseLookup> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:label "SDLC Phase Lookup Table"@en ;
                                                   
                                                   rdfs:comment """ETL lookup table for sdlcLinkDirection calculation:

ARTEFACT CLASS → SDLC PHASE:
  Epic, UserStory, RequirementCandidate,
  Suggestion, Improvement, NewFeature     → Requirements
  ArchitectureDocument, DesignModel,
  Prototype                               → Design
  SprintTask, CodeCommit                  → Implementation
  TestCase, TestResult                    → Testing
  Version, PlannedRelease                 → Deployment
  Bug, Documentation, SupportRequest,
  BuildFailure, ProblemTicket             → Maintenance

SDLC DIRECTION RULES:
  sourcePhase == targetPhase              → Horizontal
  sourcePhase precedes targetPhase        → Forward
  sourcePhase follows targetPhase         → Backward
  phases are non-adjacent (skip ≥1)      → CrossCutting

PHASE ORDER: Requirements < Design < Implementation
             < Testing < Deployment < Maintenance

EXAMPLES:
  UserStory → SprintTask:  Requirements→Implementation = Forward
  Bug → UserStory:         Maintenance→Requirements    = Backward
  TestCase → UserStory:    Testing→Requirements        = CrossCutting
  Bug → Bug:               Maintenance→Maintenance     = Horizontal"""@en .



###  http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SWRLRegistry

<http://www.ub.bw/ontologies/arto#SWRLRegistry> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:label "ARTO SWRL Rules Registry"@en ;
                                                
                                                rdfs:comment """ARTO SWRL Rules — enter in Protégé SWRLTab + Drools

R1 — Transitive Impact Propagation (CQ4) [M2]:
UserStory(?s) ^ hasImplementingTask(?s,?t) ^ SprintTask(?t)
  -> impacts(?s,?t)
UserStory(?s) ^ hasImplementingTask(?s,?t) ^ tracesTo(?t,?c)
  ^ CodeCommit(?c) -> impacts(?s,?c)
Bug(?b) ^ reportedIn(?b,?s) ^ UserStory(?s)
  -> impacts(?b,?s)
Bug(?b) ^ causes(?b,?b2) ^ Bug(?b2)
  -> impacts(?b,?b2)

R2 — Test Coverage Inference (CQ3/CQ5) [M2]:
TestCase(?tc) ^ verifies(?tc,?s) ^ UserStory(?s)
  -> hasTraceLink(?s,?tc)
TestCase(?tc) ^ verifies(?tc,?b) ^ Bug(?b)
  -> hasTraceLink(?b,?tc)

R3 — Semantic Equivalence Propagation (CQ8) [M4]:
AgileArtefact(?v1) ^ AgileArtefact(?v2) ^
  skos:exactMatch(?v1,?v2) ^ hasTraceLink(?v1,?l)
  -> hasTraceLink(?v2,?l)
AgileArtefact(?v1) ^ AgileArtefact(?v2) ^
  skos:exactMatch(?v1,?v2) ^ impacts(?v1,?t)
  -> impacts(?v2,?t)

R4 — OrphanArtefact Classification (CQ5) [M1/M2]:
Implemented via owl:equivalentClass in M1 Step 2:
  OrphanArtefact ≡ AgileArtefact AND (hasTraceLink exactly 0)
Production: SPARQL MINUS (Closed World Assumption)
  SELECT ?a WHERE {
    ?a a arto:AgileArtefact .
    MINUS { ?a arto:hasTraceLink ?l . }
  }"""@en .



